  "description": "At the funeral of the older close friend he secretly harbored an unrequited crush on, nineteen-year-old Jeon Min-wook resolves to raise his friend's left-behind six-year-old son, Han Si-on, himself.\n\nFourteen years pass. Si-on has become a respectable medical student, while Min-wook—who started out as a low-level thug—has risen to become the CEO of a successful company.\n\nHaving developed insomnia while struggling through those harsh years, Min-wook begins a bedtime routine on his doctor's recommendation. But starting from a certain day, he keeps having strange dreams where he is entangled naked with Si-on... *(Source: Lezhin, translated)*\n\n**Original Webtoon:**  \n[Lezhin](https://www.lezhin.com/ko/comic/lookalike)",
